sequenceDiagram
    actor Judge
    participant UI as Review Form
    participant Controller as ReviewController
    participant DB as Database

    Judge->>UI: Enter scores and feedback
    UI->>Controller: POST /papers/{paper}/reviews
    Controller->>DB: Verify reviewer assignment
    Controller->>DB: Confirm rubric status is locked
    Controller->>Controller: Validate scores against max_score
    Controller->>Controller: Calculate weighted total
    Controller->>DB: Save review with scores_json, comment, is_submitted, locked_at
    DB-->>Controller: Review saved
    Controller-->>UI: Show submitted and locked review
